grounded in the brain

02:54:00.770 --> 02:54:02.050
or not grounded in the brain.

02:54:02.050 --> 02:54:04.510
I think it's a really
interesting area for discovery.

02:54:04.510 --> 02:54:06.940
And I appreciate that you bring it up,

02:54:06.940 --> 02:54:09.700
and you bring it up in the
non-pressured way that you do.

02:54:09.700 --> 02:54:11.840
I think that it will
stimulate a lot of thinking,

02:54:11.840 --> 02:54:14.963
which is ultimately the
goal of this podcast.

